This repository includes data derived from third-party projects, under their own licences:

- faultline/fixtures/boutique.json, sockshop.json, trainticket.json: cases boiled down from the RCAEval
  benchmark (https://github.com/phamquiluan/RCAEval, dataset https://huggingface.co/datasets/phamquiluan/RCAEval),
  MIT licence; the licence text is in licenses/RCAEval-MIT.txt.
- faultline/fixtures/manifests.json: Kubernetes manifests, reduced to the fields Hypocenter reads (secret values
  dropped), from Online Boutique (GoogleCloudPlatform/microservices-demo), Sock Shop
  (microservices-demo/microservices-demo) and Train Ticket (FudanSELab/train-ticket), each Apache License 2.0.
- faultline/fixtures/boutique_owners.json, boutique_releases.json: owners, contributors, releases and commit
  metadata of Online Boutique (GoogleCloudPlatform/microservices-demo, Apache License 2.0), from its public
  repository.

Not included: the list of public post-mortems (github.com/danluu/post-mortems) has no licence, so it is only ever
fetched onto the user's own machine by `python -m faultline.public_postmortems --fetch` and never committed.

Kestrel Pay and Harbor Freight, including Kestrel's chat, are synthetic and written for this project.
